a very small team of 3 game developers, a programmer, an artist, an a composer, we put our best efforts in every project we do and we do always give it our all.We’ve taken upon ourselves the task of making TeaKnights, our biggest and most ambitious game so far. This game means a lot to us and is full of love and passion. Every single project we have done so far has been developed, self-funded and self-published entirely by ourselves.That said, we’ve decided to launch ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T17:58:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329266264","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4863130-1836506165554565","game_id":"steam-4863130","kind":"announcement","title":"TeaKnights | Dynamic Music Teaser - Skule Toyama","summary":"TeaKnights is a rail-shooter inspired from the likes of Star Fox & Sin & Punishment, however like its musical predecessor PopSlinger it has a DYNAMIC SOUNDTRACK! Check out our groovy Y2K tunes! SkuleToyama cooked with this one! Support us on PATREON! We need your help in making this game! teaknights.comFollow us!X: FunkyCanDevBsky: FunkyCanCreativeInstagram: funkycancreative","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T16:32:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165554565","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4863130-1836506165547145","game_id":"steam-4863130","kind":"announcement","title":"We've got a Patreon!","summary":"We at Funky Can Creative love to make games and we'll keep doing it until we drop! But making games is a task that requires alot of effort and resources, and we would REALLY appreciate your support in this endeavor so we can create more games together!That's why we've launched a Patreon where you can support us if you want to, and in exchange, we'll show you our gratitude with a variety of cool suff from our new game in development, \"TeaKnights\"!Goodies include:Early access to demo builds so you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T21:26:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165547145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4863130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4863130":"2026-10-26T04:47:50Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4863130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5129500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:47:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4863130","app_id":4863130,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:03Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"78b572b03501791ce3e0b24ebdd69222c0959c6f24461950056463d6c8c48f9f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"TeaKnights is a Y2K-inspired musical rail shooter set across seven tea-powered biodomes. As apprentice Camellia Jetsworth, blast enemies with TeaSetter REGALIAS, build chain combos to drive the dynamic soundtrack, face bosses, aid fellow knights, explore the overworld, and customize your look.","publishers":[{"name":"Funky Can Creative"}],"developers":[{"name":"Funky Can Creative"}],"franchises":[{"name":"PopSl